<h2 id="scope-and-terms">Scope and terms</h2>
<h3 id="glossary">Glossary</h3>
<details><summary>Glossary, 2 rows and 3 columns</summary><div class="shaped"><div class="entry"><p class="sub"><b>Kalah</b>. Tag: verified.</p><p><b>Definition:</b> A board game for two players.</p></div><div class="entry"><p class="sub"><b>Family</b>. Tag: verified.</p><p><b>Definition:</b> One of four groups of methods.</p></div></div></details>
<h3 id="columns">Columns</h3>
<details><summary>Column definitions, 1 rows and 4 columns</summary><div class="shaped"><div class="entry"><p class="sub"><b>Weighted tokens</b>. Tag: recomputed.</p><p><b>Definition:</b> Model tokens weighted by price.</p></div></div></details>
